# The arrow keys fold like h and l: Left collapses a project, Right expands it and a second Right enters it.
file <<END
Packing:
	- Passport
	- Charger
Notes
END
keys <Left>
see Packing: ▸ 2
hide Passport
keys <Right>
see - Passport
keys <Right> x
quit
saved <<END
Packing:
	- Passport @done({today})
	- Charger
Notes
END
